 drink?\n   - Position 2 drinks coffee.\n\n4. What job does the person who drinks juice have?\n   - The person who drinks juice is in position 1, whose job is musician.\n\n### Final Output:\n<solution>1, fisherman, coffee, musician</solution>\n\nFinal answer: <solution>1, fisherman, coffee, musician</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "Let", "logprob": -0.19465628266334534}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.02195342443883419}, {"token": " break", "logprob": -1.088252067565918}, {"token": " down", "logprob": -0.1295156627893448}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.057455651462078094}, {"token": " problem", "logprob": -0.28141292929649353}, {"token": " step", "logprob": -0.059621188789606094}, {"token": " by", "logprob": -0.07896333932876587}, {"token": " step", "logprob": -0.0013363964390009642}, {"token": " using", "logprob": -0.7595975399017334}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.021365482360124588}, {"token": " given", "logprob": -0.26739612221717834}, {"token": " constraints", "logprob": -1.3689395189285278}, {"token": ".\n\n", "logprob": -0.430529922246933}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -0.06739038228988647}, {"token": " Given", "logprob": -0.4926789104938507}, {"token": " Information", "logprob": -2.2840030193328857}, {"token": ":\n", "logprob": -0.04695158451795578}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -0.8614632487297058}, {"token": " Two", "logprob": -2.896146774291992}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -0.04999760538339615}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.3266793191432953}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.45719194412231445}, {"token": " line", "logprob": -0.00039772229501977563}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.4169994592666626}, {"token": " Position", "logprob": -0.7585809826850891}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.023526566103100777}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -9.298280929215252e-06}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.6376204490661621}, {"token": " Position", "logprob": -0.002764096949249506}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -3.933898824470816e-06}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -2.002696055569